    "answer": {
      "short": "Courier: \\$83 993 p.a.; delivery driver: \\$87 141.60 p.a. The delivery driver earns \\$3148.60 more per year.",
      "worked": "The courier earns \\$83 993 per year. Using 52 weeks per year:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Delivery weekly pay} &= \\$44.10\\times38\\\\&=\\$1675.80\\\\\\text{Delivery annual pay} &= \\$1675.80\\times52\\\\&=\\$87\\,141.60\\\\\\text{Difference} &= \\$87\\,141.60-\\$83\\,993\\\\&=\\$3148.60\\end{align*}$$\nThe delivery driver earns \\$3148.60 more per year.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
